      "card_ids": ["C16", "C19"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "L3 oral AUC/Cmax records show measurable human oral exposure for reference molecules M01 and M03 and for a metabolite of M02, but none includes an IV comparator or an absolute F value; they do not alter the high direction.",
